# EXPECT: `break` inside a `try` body
# Round 153: a `break` that leaves a try body would jump out with the
# handler still pushed; a later error would longjmp into a dead frame.
# Refused by name until the emitter pops on the way out.
for i in range of 5:
    try:
        if i == 2:
            break
        print of i
    catch e:
        print of "never"
